From d3aa66d17690513e637ebd58ccb066d0d84f44fd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Randolph <randolph@andestech.com>
Date: Mon, 14 Oct 2024 10:51:38 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 27/53] swdtb: add generic DMA properties for legacy built-in
 DTBs (#130)

The legacy DMA of some built-in DTBs missed the following properties:

In the MMC node:
dmas = <0x07 0x09>;
dma-names = "rxtx";

In the DMA node:
"#dma-cells = <0x01>;"

Because the legacy FPGA bitmaps lack DMA coherence in the FDT's root,
reading the DMA-coherent type from the MMC node is necessary.

Bugzilla: http://e-andes.andestech.com/bugzilla5/show_bug.cgi?id=31805

Signed-off-by: Randolph <randolph@andestech.com>
Reviewed-on: https://gitea.andestech.com/RD-SW/u-boot.official/pulls/130
Reviewed-by: Leo Yu-Chi Liang <ycliang@andestech.com>
Reviewed-by: Tim Shih-Ting OuYang <tim609@andestech.com>
Co-authored-by: Randolph <randolph@andestech.com>
Co-committed-by: Randolph <randolph@andestech.com>
